1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,215
Every morning, planes drew white lines
across the sky over Addis.

2
00:00:04,015 --> 00:00:06,440
I used to think they were writing to me.

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,630
So I chased them.

4
00:00:08,430 --> 00:00:12,267
Documentaries at midnight, not to study,
just to be near it.

5
00:00:12,067 --> 00:00:14,510
Whatever I could find online, I read.

6
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:18,060
I watched landings the way other kids
watched football.

7
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:24,439
Then Ethiopian Airlines opened a
sponsored trainee pilot program.

8
00:00:24,239 --> 00:00:25,030
I applied.

9
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:31,530
Age. Documents. Written test. Passed.
Interview. Passed.

10
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:36,600
Simulation test. Passed. English
proficiency. Passed.

11
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:43,000
One test left. The medical. My eyes.

12
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:47,910
Not cleared. Two words, and the sky
closed.

13
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:51,850
For weeks, I couldn't look up.

14
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:59,380
But the sky never asked for my eyes. It
asked for my curiosity.

15
00:00:59,180 --> 00:01:01,600
So I kept learning, and I built this.

16
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:08,150
My eyes failed one test. My curiosity
hasn't failed one yet.

17
00:01:07,950 --> 00:01:09,570
I'm not done looking up.
